{"4798290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eon Leap VR", "steam_appid": 4798290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eon Leap VR is a story-based Sci-Fi Hack and Slash game for VR devices. You play as a Private Military Company Agent who gets assigned to highly dangerous missions. The game primarily focuses on sword combat. The player has to rely on their maneuverability, which includes dashing and time slow mechanics, to take down enemies. The game isn't limited to these mechanics. You get tons of puzzles and interactions throughout the game. The first mission requires the player to reach to a Research Facility in a Pod in order to commence the mission. Along the way, the player finds lots of enemy ships to take down. Upon reaching the player has to deal with a horde of enemies in order to accomplish the mission. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eon Leap VR is a story-based Sci-Fi Hack and Slash game for VR devices. You play as a Private Military Company Agent who gets assigned to highly dangerous missions. The game primarily focuses on sword combat. The player has to rely on their maneuverability, which includes dashing and time slow mechanics, to take down enemies. The game isn't limited to these mechanics. You get tons of puzzles and interactions throughout the game. The first mission requires the player to reach to a Research Facility in a Pod in order to commence the mission. Along the way, the player finds lots of enemy ships to take down. Upon reaching the player has to deal with a horde of enemies in order to accomplish the mission. </p>", "short_description": "Eon Leap VR is a story-based Sci-Fi Hack and Slash game for VR devices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4798290/8b7ce1cc93c281c9789910a2ba17a61406e6